WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:00.980
<b>Speed Dating Café 
Meow Meow</b>

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.640
<b>LOVE x Massage</b>

00:00:08.150 --> 00:00:11.440
Um...

00:00:11.440 --> 00:00:16.200
Do you think you could give
my Chisato here a job?

00:00:16.200 --> 00:00:17.120
How about it?

00:00:17.230 --> 00:00:20.530
You know that's impossible.

00:00:20.530 --> 00:00:22.900
All you need to work here is a mouth, right?

00:00:22.900 --> 00:00:23.860
She's got that!

00:00:23.860 --> 00:00:26.390
That's not it.

00:00:26.390 --> 00:00:30.960
Yonamine-san, your daughter's
still a minor, right?

00:00:30.960 --> 00:00:33.060
Maybe we could've gotten
away with that years ago,

00:00:33.060 --> 00:00:35.600
but nobody takes risks like that anymore.

00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:37.620
Come on, I'm begging you.

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:39.890
Sorry, not happening.

00:00:41.990 --> 00:00:45.220
<i>I have nothing.</i>

00:00:52.770 --> 00:00:53.770
Shit!

00:01:09.300 --> 00:01:11.080
You can't even work in a whorehouse,

00:01:11.080 --> 00:01:12.740
you freeloader!

00:01:12.930 --> 00:01:16.590
The money from the government
doesn't pay for a thing!

00:01:32.210 --> 00:01:35.360
Why did your mom have to die?

00:01:35.360 --> 00:01:38.820
If you'd died instead,
this never would've happened!

00:01:38.820 --> 00:01:39.810
Damn it!

00:01:39.810 --> 00:01:40.780
Damn it!

00:01:40.780 --> 00:01:42.120
Damn it!

00:01:43.850 --> 00:01:46.660
<i>Am I going to die here?</i>

00:02:10.970 --> 00:02:12.480
Wh-Who the hell are you?

00:02:30.250 --> 00:02:32.410
I have something important
to talk to you about.

00:02:33.850 --> 00:02:36.080
Do you want to be a Magical Girl?

00:04:09.970 --> 00:04:14.940
<b>You'll Surely Be a Wonderful Magical Girl</b>

00:04:15.590 --> 00:04:16.890
Blue skies!

00:04:17.040 --> 00:04:18.600
White beaches!

00:04:18.600 --> 00:04:20.570
It's the ocean!

00:04:20.570 --> 00:04:23.530
<b>Gino Bay, Okinawa Prefecture</b>

00:04:23.900 --> 00:04:26.100
This is a fancy place for a field trip.

00:04:26.100 --> 00:04:28.610
It costs a lot,

00:04:28.610 --> 00:04:30.500
but it's optional.

00:04:30.500 --> 00:04:31.390
Over here!

00:04:31.390 --> 00:04:33.220
They said we can split watermelons!

00:04:33.220 --> 00:04:34.750
I'm coming!

00:04:35.060 --> 00:04:37.000
By the way, where's Kurumi-san?

00:04:37.000 --> 00:04:39.030
She said she'd be here late.

00:04:39.030 --> 00:04:40.720
I see.

00:04:46.660 --> 00:04:48.590
Peace, huh?

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:07.450
I may still be able to reattach your arm.

00:05:09.060 --> 00:05:12.920
I've got something important
to do, and I'm in a hurry.

00:05:12.920 --> 00:05:15.180
So I'll make this quick.

00:05:15.820 --> 00:05:19.550
Please tell me everything
you know about your employer.

00:05:19.710 --> 00:05:21.430
I don't know anything!

00:05:21.430 --> 00:05:24.510
The person who hired
me was in the Russian mafia.

00:05:24.750 --> 00:05:27.610
Have you ever heard
of the Babel Brigade?

00:05:27.610 --> 00:05:29.680
N-No!

00:05:33.020 --> 00:05:36.940
How do I seem to you?

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:39.940
What do you think of me?

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:43.860
War Nurse from the Magical Five!

00:05:45.670 --> 00:05:47.060
An angelic nurse!

00:05:47.060 --> 00:05:49.510
Very cute! Super cute!

00:05:49.510 --> 00:05:51.430
Incredibly cute!

00:05:51.430 --> 00:05:53.790
War Nurse, you're an angel!

00:05:54.060 --> 00:05:55.340
Thank you.

00:05:55.770 --> 00:05:59.250
But I'm no angel.

00:05:59.450 --> 00:06:02.750
Doing all of the Magical Five's
 dirty work was my job.

00:06:03.930 --> 00:06:06.360
It wasn't something I was forced to do.

00:06:06.670 --> 00:06:08.110
You know,

00:06:08.110 --> 00:06:11.020
I can't make the person I care
about torture someone, right?

00:06:15.500 --> 00:06:19.630
<i>They're blew up that
picture from the photo booth.</i>

00:06:20.040 --> 00:06:22.020
<i>They've got too much
free time on their hands.</i>

00:06:24.640 --> 00:06:27.810
<i>The teacher's pretending
he doesn't even see it.</i>

00:06:27.810 --> 00:06:32.570
<i>Do I have to fight the Disas
to protect people like this?</i>

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:37.200
<i>I could transform into
a Magical Girl right now.</i>

00:06:37.810 --> 00:06:40.920
<i>I could kill them all if I wanted.</i>

00:06:47.940 --> 00:06:49.040
Come with me.

00:06:49.040 --> 00:06:52.350
There's no time to waste
on these worthless people.

00:06:53.520 --> 00:06:55.180
<i>They were worthless,</i>

00:06:55.180 --> 00:06:57.410
<i>and you said so.</i>

00:06:58.070 --> 00:06:59.970
<i>That's what saved me.</i>

00:07:00.250 --> 00:07:02.130
<i>That honesty of yours.</i>

00:07:03.930 --> 00:07:08.660
<i>I know how easily
my Asuka-san can be hurt.</i>

00:07:08.660 --> 00:07:12.710
<i>So I volunteered for anything
I thought would hurt you.</i>

00:07:14.200 --> 00:07:18.170
Let's inject your brain with
something that'll make you feel good.

00:07:26.110 --> 00:07:28.330
What is this?

00:07:28.500 --> 00:07:33.000
A magical drug that makes your
senses dozens of times sharper.

00:07:33.000 --> 00:07:35.840
If I touch your sensitive parts,
or do anything to hurt you,

00:07:35.840 --> 00:07:38.890
you're in for a rough time.

00:07:39.320 --> 00:07:41.450
You have magical power,

00:07:41.450 --> 00:07:43.960
so it may not work as well on you.

00:07:44.520 --> 00:07:46.580
But the more you resist,

00:07:46.830 --> 00:07:48.670
the worse it will be later.

00:07:49.560 --> 00:07:51.280
Magical Spanking!

00:07:52.930 --> 00:07:54.190
<i>Asuka-san,</i>

00:07:54.190 --> 00:07:59.740
<i>I can do anything for you!</i>

00:08:00.760 --> 00:08:04.980
<i>I want to be useful to you.</i>

00:08:11.240 --> 00:08:12.460
Oh no,

00:08:12.460 --> 00:08:13.920
I'm late!

00:08:17.930 --> 00:08:23.390
<b>Naha Garrison, Naha City, Okinawa Prefecture</b>

00:08:27.600 --> 00:08:30.570
You remember what I said about
the Topology Bridge, right?

00:08:30.950 --> 00:08:33.320
We built a nuclear fallout shelter

00:08:33.320 --> 00:08:36.280
disguised as a hangar
on top of the Stable Bridge.

00:08:38.240 --> 00:08:41.020
The bridge lies behind this reinforced door.

00:08:41.020 --> 00:08:46.460
Next week, the largest inter-world
trade conference in years will be held.

00:08:46.650 --> 00:08:51.550
The 6th WTO Two-World
Multilateral Conference on Trade.

00:08:51.550 --> 00:08:53.850
The "6th Naha."

00:08:53.850 --> 00:08:57.600
The conference is kept an
absolute secret from the public.

00:08:58.020 --> 00:09:01.410
Security is handled solely by US
and Japanese special forces units.

00:09:01.410 --> 00:09:04.960
Observers will also be coming from
the UN Magical Security Council.

00:09:06.370 --> 00:09:09.310
A major figure from the Spirit World
 will be coming, too.

00:09:09.710 --> 00:09:13.070
Ideally, nothing happens, but...

00:09:13.320 --> 00:09:15.560
Things have been strange lately.

00:09:16.110 --> 00:09:18.780
We're going to protect this
conference if it costs us our lives!

00:09:18.900 --> 00:09:19.960
Roger.

00:09:23.650 --> 00:09:26.170
This is so yummy! So much fun!

00:09:28.730 --> 00:09:31.700
D-Did I make it in time for dinner?

00:09:31.700 --> 00:09:32.960
Good.

00:09:32.960 --> 00:09:34.390
You caught up.

00:09:39.430 --> 00:09:40.980
<i>She's out of her uniform.</i>

00:09:45.040 --> 00:09:47.180
<i>Dinner's over,</i>

00:09:47.180 --> 00:09:48.890
<i>and now it's time to go to sleep.</i>

00:09:49.740 --> 00:09:51.920
<i>I'll be sleeping in the same
room as Asuka-san,</i>

00:09:51.920 --> 00:09:53.610
<i>and it's just the two of us!</i>

00:09:53.780 --> 00:09:57.420
<i>Wh-What could be better?</i>

00:10:03.540 --> 00:10:08.020
The Disas are trying to establish
a front line base here.

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:10.460
We need to flatten them.

00:10:10.460 --> 00:10:16.090
The other three are fighting on
the other side of the planet right now, chu!

00:10:16.200 --> 00:10:18.800
Until we meet up with them,

00:10:18.800 --> 00:10:21.970
I'll be our leader. That's okay, right?

00:10:22.060 --> 00:10:22.940
Yeah.

00:10:22.940 --> 00:10:26.060
You've got some personality
problems, but sure.

00:10:26.060 --> 00:10:27.680
Personality problems?

00:10:28.250 --> 00:10:29.440
Where?

00:10:29.440 --> 00:10:31.140
Right there!

00:10:32.030 --> 00:10:33.740
Leader's orders!

00:10:33.740 --> 00:10:36.610
Asuka, come to my bedroom tonight.

00:10:36.720 --> 00:10:38.330
Of course not.

00:10:38.330 --> 00:10:39.690
That's right!

00:10:39.690 --> 00:10:41.440
How disgusting.

00:10:41.520 --> 00:10:43.700
I was kidding!

00:10:45.480 --> 00:10:49.680
<i>Francine was the strongest Magical Girl.</i>

00:10:49.680 --> 00:10:51.660
<i>I looked up to her.</i>

00:10:54.040 --> 00:10:55.750
<i>We lost our leader.</i>

00:10:58.460 --> 00:11:00.590
<i>We lost so many of our comrades.</i>

00:11:12.690 --> 00:11:14.560
<i>I joined the spec ops group,</i>

00:11:14.900 --> 00:11:16.740
<i>and came back to the battlefield.</i>

00:11:17.760 --> 00:11:19.640
<i>What will I lose now?</i>

00:11:20.040 --> 00:11:21.310
<i>Who will I lose?</i>

00:11:22.560 --> 00:11:26.300
<i>How much do I have to lose
to make real peace come?</i>

00:11:28.840 --> 00:11:29.890
<i>Kurumi?</i>

00:11:35.590 --> 00:11:37.320
<i>I swear I'll protect you.</i>

00:11:38.560 --> 00:11:40.020
<i>I'll protect this world.</i>

00:11:40.960 --> 00:11:42.280
<i>I won't run anymore,</i>

00:11:42.600 --> 00:11:44.160
<i>no matter how much it hurts.</i>

00:11:47.350 --> 00:11:48.560
But...

00:11:49.040 --> 00:11:51.230
Why is she sleeping in my bed?

00:11:52.400 --> 00:11:55.010
She looks really happy, too.

00:12:02.400 --> 00:12:03.700
<b>JSOC 
Magic Operations Response Group (MORG)
Captain Larry Ironside</b>

00:12:03.910 --> 00:12:05.410
<b>Sergeant Major Mia Cyrus</b>

00:12:05.590 --> 00:12:06.900
Larry...

00:12:06.900 --> 00:12:08.890
Good to see you again.

00:12:08.890 --> 00:12:11.380
It's good to see you again, Iizuka-san.

00:12:14.980 --> 00:12:17.850
The UN's Magical Security
Council observers, huh?

00:12:17.850 --> 00:12:25.230
Tamara Volkov is participating
with them as an observer.

00:12:25.230 --> 00:12:27.160
Hey, Russian.

00:12:27.160 --> 00:12:29.800
It's been a while, Texas Girl.

00:12:30.200 --> 00:12:32.270
Are you still as stupid and reckless as ever?

00:12:32.680 --> 00:12:37.320
I see you're still basically a robot, too.

00:12:37.320 --> 00:12:39.270
Stop it, Mia.

00:12:40.610 --> 00:12:45.230
Two JSDF Magical Girls
are in Okinawa already.

00:12:45.230 --> 00:12:48.090
There are three days until
the 6th Naha begins.

00:12:48.090 --> 00:12:52.080
The US and Japanese special forces and 
Magical Girls will take the lead on security.

00:12:52.220 --> 00:12:57.050
We have information that a magic-using
terrorist organization is up to something.

00:13:00.580 --> 00:13:03.350
I have nothing.

00:13:04.020 --> 00:13:05.900
No dreams. No hope.

00:13:05.900 --> 00:13:09.300
Nothing I can do.

00:13:09.300 --> 00:13:12.480
You're right. The world
is filled with awful things.

00:13:12.480 --> 00:13:15.450
But there's something you can do.

00:13:16.580 --> 00:13:18.270
There is?

00:13:18.270 --> 00:13:22.690
I want you to become a 
Magical Girl and fight for us.

00:13:22.810 --> 00:13:24.480
Fight?

00:13:24.480 --> 00:13:26.130
Kill people?

00:13:26.130 --> 00:13:28.550
That's what Magical Girls do, right?

00:13:30.700 --> 00:13:32.560
I was born in the Horn of Africa.

00:13:32.560 --> 00:13:34.390
Somalia.

00:13:34.390 --> 00:13:39.080
And I became a child soldier
and killed many people.

00:13:40.640 --> 00:13:41.750
I was just like you.

00:13:42.220 --> 00:13:47.470
With no hope, and facing a sad death...

00:13:47.960 --> 00:13:49.830
When the brigade commander saved me.

00:13:50.430 --> 00:13:52.880
I was given this body and hope.

00:13:53.440 --> 00:13:55.890
Your body?

00:13:56.410 --> 00:13:57.450
Want to see?

00:14:00.930 --> 00:14:02.590
I promise you.

00:14:02.590 --> 00:14:04.810
The brigade commander kills people,

00:14:04.810 --> 00:14:07.120
but she gives us hope.

00:14:07.610 --> 00:14:09.010
Hope...

00:14:11.330 --> 00:14:14.880
This is made using the same
technology as my body.

00:14:15.760 --> 00:14:16.730
What's that?

00:14:17.440 --> 00:14:21.820
Do you want use this leg to run
free in the outside world?

00:14:23.260 --> 00:14:25.630
<i>My hope...</i>

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:59.320
Magical Girl Whiplash Chisato.

00:15:04.500 --> 00:15:09.090
This is a Greed-class Disas monster
we prepared to test your abilities.

00:15:09.090 --> 00:15:12.050
It's more powerful than a Voorhees-class, gi!

00:15:26.320 --> 00:15:30.210
The way she uses that thing
after only training a few times...

00:15:30.210 --> 00:15:33.790
We might have a prodigy on our hands, gi.

00:15:34.680 --> 00:15:36.220
She'll probably make it in time.

00:15:39.700 --> 00:15:42.160
We're going to practice clothed swimming!

00:15:42.300 --> 00:15:43.650
When you're rescuing somebody,

00:15:43.650 --> 00:15:46.630
you need to be able to swim
with your clothes on.

00:15:55.540 --> 00:15:57.700
This is Kaori-san,

00:15:57.700 --> 00:15:59.700
our CPR practice mannequin.

00:15:59.800 --> 00:16:02.090
What's CPR?

00:16:02.090 --> 00:16:04.650
Cardiopulmonary resuscitation.

00:16:06.210 --> 00:16:09.100
That's what it's short for, obviously.

00:16:10.110 --> 00:16:12.040
Is that common knowledge?

00:16:12.810 --> 00:16:16.010
Maybe it's not obvious.

00:16:27.740 --> 00:16:29.810
<i>I wish I was that mannequin.</i>

00:16:29.810 --> 00:16:31.580
Way to go, Asuka!

00:16:31.580 --> 00:16:33.580
She looks so practiced.

00:16:33.580 --> 00:16:34.660
Hey,

00:16:34.660 --> 00:16:37.400
aren't you guys taking
this a little too seriously?

00:16:37.400 --> 00:16:39.190
Relax!

00:16:39.970 --> 00:16:41.170
Sorry.

00:16:41.170 --> 00:16:43.000
Was I overdoing it?

00:16:43.000 --> 00:16:45.470
No, please teach us.

00:16:45.470 --> 00:16:46.770
Sayako?

00:16:46.770 --> 00:16:49.230
I don't know what'll happen.

00:16:49.610 --> 00:16:52.570
So I want to know more about this stuff.

00:16:55.920 --> 00:16:57.510
Yeah, you're right.

00:16:57.510 --> 00:16:58.920
Let's take it seriously.

00:17:10.620 --> 00:17:13.250
I used to do karate.

00:17:14.500 --> 00:17:18.330
Ever since I was in kindergarten,
I did a lot of contact sparring.

00:17:18.330 --> 00:17:22.520
But after the accident a year ago,
 I couldn't anymore.

00:17:23.790 --> 00:17:25.480
My mom worked for a cabaret club.

00:17:25.740 --> 00:17:29.600
She had terrible taste in men,
but she was so kind to me.

00:17:30.490 --> 00:17:32.800
When I said I wanted to learn karate,

00:17:32.800 --> 00:17:34.940
she really supported me.

00:17:34.940 --> 00:17:37.730
She was awful at cooking,

00:17:37.730 --> 00:17:41.520
but she always made me lunch
on the days when I had matches.

00:17:44.980 --> 00:17:48.280
And then I saw her crushed
right in front of me.

00:17:51.640 --> 00:17:55.420
It was four young men and
women who were driving drunk.

00:17:55.420 --> 00:17:58.340
They were minors,
so they just went to juvie.

00:17:58.340 --> 00:18:03.260
Even the driver will
be out in two years at most.

00:18:03.260 --> 00:18:04.780
That's terrible.

00:18:05.670 --> 00:18:08.010
Life is nothing but pain.

00:18:08.580 --> 00:18:09.540
But...

00:18:13.810 --> 00:18:16.700
You gave me freedom,

00:18:16.950 --> 00:18:20.100
so I think I could do anything for you.

00:18:26.330 --> 00:18:28.170
Sata andagi!

00:18:28.720 --> 00:18:31.450
I don't see any sata andagi anywhere.

00:18:31.450 --> 00:18:34.260
I just wanted to say it 'cause it sounds cool.

00:18:34.420 --> 00:18:36.220
Sata andagi!

00:18:36.220 --> 00:18:37.620
What's gotten into you?

00:18:39.760 --> 00:18:41.390
<b>Iizuka-san</b>

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:41.390
<b>Incoming Call</b>

00:18:45.970 --> 00:18:47.640
I'm on a field trip.

00:18:47.640 --> 00:18:49.810
And I was eating.

00:18:53.380 --> 00:18:55.090
A job in Okinawa?

00:19:07.210 --> 00:19:08.280
We're here.

00:19:10.490 --> 00:19:11.960
Who are they?

00:19:11.960 --> 00:19:15.460
The ones who killed your mother.

00:19:16.900 --> 00:19:19.030
We kidnapped them from juvie.

00:19:19.690 --> 00:19:23.630
You're going to suddenly find yourself
in the middle of a fierce battle.

00:19:24.110 --> 00:19:26.840
Thanks to your strong 
magical power and karate,

00:19:26.840 --> 00:19:30.400
you're going to be a powerful
 warrior-type Magical Girl.

00:19:30.940 --> 00:19:33.620
But killing someone is a different matter.

00:19:34.350 --> 00:19:36.450
The first one is what's important.

00:19:38.090 --> 00:19:41.570
I was just a normal farm boy.

00:19:42.990 --> 00:19:46.760
But my village was attacked
by armed guerrillas.

00:19:46.760 --> 00:19:48.660
We were all taken prisoner.

00:19:49.400 --> 00:19:52.620
I was almost killed by one of
them for no reason at all.

00:19:52.620 --> 00:19:54.570
So I begged for my life.

00:19:55.250 --> 00:19:58.880
And then their leader said to me...

00:19:59.140 --> 00:20:01.880
Kill your parents.

00:20:01.880 --> 00:20:04.010
Rape your sister.

00:20:04.430 --> 00:20:05.380
And if you do,

00:20:05.610 --> 00:20:07.890
we'll let you live and kill the others.

00:20:08.270 --> 00:20:09.510
You can be one of us.

00:20:14.630 --> 00:20:16.120
I did as he told me.

00:20:17.930 --> 00:20:19.340
After that,

00:20:19.340 --> 00:20:22.040
they let me join them.

00:20:22.040 --> 00:20:23.740
I killed a lot of people.

00:20:24.320 --> 00:20:27.660
But during one operation,
they left me to die.

00:20:28.740 --> 00:20:32.750
The first thing I did when the brigade
commander gave me this new body

00:20:32.750 --> 00:20:37.160
was kill every one of those guerrillas.

00:20:39.400 --> 00:20:42.740
Chisato, kill the four of them.

00:20:42.740 --> 00:20:45.090
But you can't transform.

00:20:45.550 --> 00:20:46.890
Do it with your own hands.

00:20:46.890 --> 00:20:48.300
Use the knife.

00:20:49.010 --> 00:20:52.920
Make sure you take more than
ten minutes per person when killing them.

00:20:53.440 --> 00:20:54.720
To do that,

00:20:54.720 --> 00:20:57.170
you'll have to stab them
somewhere that isn't fatal,

00:20:57.170 --> 00:20:59.090
then cut their throat to finish them.

00:20:59.520 --> 00:21:01.280
If you can't do this,

00:21:01.280 --> 00:21:02.410
Chisato,

00:21:02.410 --> 00:21:04.660
you won't be able to become a Magical Girl.

00:21:14.260 --> 00:21:15.860
Thank you, Giess...

00:21:17.190 --> 00:21:20.080
For finding people that 
will be so easy for me to kill.

00:21:26.840 --> 00:21:28.130
Chisato!

00:21:29.300 --> 00:21:30.840
I'm fine. I can keep doing this.

00:21:31.550 --> 00:21:32.930
I told you...

00:21:33.530 --> 00:21:38.450
I think I can do anything for you.

00:21:48.650 --> 00:21:52.640
Maybe she was so tired from
killing them that she passed out.

00:21:53.590 --> 00:21:56.110
She's fast asleep.

00:21:56.740 --> 00:22:00.420
If she can kill four people
like that, she passes, gi!

00:22:03.090 --> 00:22:07.170
An expeditionary strike brigade
made from surviving Disas.

00:22:07.170 --> 00:22:11.310
They come equipped with a full
set of close air support capabilities, gi.

00:22:12.030 --> 00:22:13.880
From the look of it,

00:22:13.880 --> 00:22:15.900
Chisato will be a great help, too.

00:22:16.680 --> 00:22:21.270
We begin deployment at midnight tonight.

00:22:21.870 --> 00:22:25.500
The attack on the 6th Naha
will proceed as planned.

00:23:57.360 --> 00:23:58.710
The enemy Magical Girl,

00:23:58.710 --> 00:24:00.750
as well as the commanders
of the Babel Brigade, attack!

00:24:00.750 --> 00:24:04.430
Two types of indirect fire turns 
Naha Garrison into a sea of flames!

00:24:04.430 --> 00:24:07.080
Can Asuka and the
others stop the enemy?

00:24:07.080 --> 00:24:08.790
Next time: "The Lid of Hell."

00:24:07.380 --> 00:24:09.590
<b>The Lid of Hell</b>

00:24:08.790 --> 00:24:11.720
With your Magical Karambit,
rip the bad guys to pieces, chu!
